### =========================================================================
### 1. Create Event (Draft) - Requires Organizer / Admin Auth
### =========================================================================
# Route: POST /api/v1/organizer/events
# Note: Creates event with status DRAFT. Ensure categoryId 1 and venueId 1 exist.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/organizer/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "EventSphere Tech Summit 2026",
  "description": "Advanced REST API Development & Cloud Systems Conference",
  "bannerUrl": "https://example.com/banners/tech-summit.jpg",
  "startDatetime": "2026-09-10T09:00:00",
  "endDatetime": "2026-09-10T17:00:00",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "venueId": 1
}

###

### =========================================================================
### 2. Get All Published Events (Public)
### =========================================================================
# Route: GET /api/v1/events
# Supports pagination (e.g., page=0&size=10) and filtering parameters.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/events?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Publish Event #1
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/organizer/events/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}